  "canon:title": "Why may epsilon-aminocaproic acid (EACA) induce myopathy in man? Report of a case and literature review.",
  "canon:abstract": "A case of necrotizing myopathy due to a short epsilon-aminocaproic acid (EACA) treatment in a 72 year-old patient with subarachnoid haemorrhage (SAH) is described. Pathogenetic hypotheses are discussed.",
  "canon:text": "Why may epsilon-aminocaproic acid (EACA) induce myopathy in man? Report of a case and literature review. A case of necrotizing myopathy due to a short epsilon-aminocaproic acid (EACA) treatment in a 72 year-old patient with subarachnoid haemorrhage (SAH) is described. Pathogenetic hypotheses are discussed.",
